Stop importing a package while looking up one of its submodules. The frozen module
check asked ``importlib.util.find_spec`` for the dotted name, which imports the
parent, so a package in the analysed project that shares its name with a standard
library module (``test``, ``code``, ``xmlrpc``, ...) was executed as soon as a
missing name was looked up in it.

Refs #2684
